y We will save you in body that you may be to those who succeed you a sign. And indeed, many among the people, of Our signs, are heedless.","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":92,"sd":null},{"k":"10:93","t":"And We had certainly settled the Children of Israel in an agreeable settlement and provided them with good things. And they did not differ until [after] knowledge had come to them. Indeed, your Lord will judge between them on the Day of Resurrection concerning that over which they used to differ.","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":93,"sd":null},{"k":"10:94","t":"So if you are in doubt, [O Muḥammad], about that which We have revealed to you, then ask those who have been reading the Scripture before you. The truth has certainly come to you from your Lord, so never be among the doubters.","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":94,"sd":null},{"k":"10:95","t":"And never be of those who deny the signs of Allāh and [thus] be among the losers.","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":95,"sd":null},{"k":"10:96","t":"Indeed, those upon whom the word [i.e., decree] of your Lord has come into effect will not believe,","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":96,"sd":null},{"k":"10:97","t":"Even if every sign should come to them, until they see the painful punishment.","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":97,"sd":null}],"juz":11,"hizb":22,"surahs":[10],"sajdah":false}